Interoperability notes (formats only; no code from these projects is included):

  - The mapfile written by the data-rescue engine is compatible with GNU
    ddrescue's mapfile format. The backup image format is compatible with
    Partclone's image format 0002 and the LZ4 frame format.
  - LUKS1/LUKS2 (dm-crypt data layer) and BitLocker are implemented from the
    public on-disk format documentation. Test vectors under core/tests are
    outputs of public reference implementations (hashlib, cryptography,
    argon2-cffi) and carry no code.
